@IDS.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5141
@accessToken = replace-with-an-authenticated-access-token
@commonUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@siteId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@contractorId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

GET {{IDS.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Prévia calculada com os pesos atuais (não é o IDS salvo)
GET {{IDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/monthly-close-compositions/{{siteId}}/average/2026/10?contractorId={{contractorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Associa registros gerais legados; retorna 409 sem alterações se houver conflitos
POST {{IDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/ipf/associate-legacy
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contractorId": "{{contractorId}}",
  "siteId": "{{siteId}}"
}

### Histórico salvo do projeto (months[].idsAverage é o snapshot)
GET {{IDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/ipf/2026?contractorId={{contractorId}}&siteId={{siteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Sugestão ponderada atual para o projeto
GET {{IDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/ipf/2026/10/suggestion?contractorId={{contractorId}}&siteId={{siteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Recalcular e salvar projeto
PUT {{IDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports/ipf/2026/10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contractorOrganizationId": "{{contractorId}}",
  "siteId": "{{siteId}}",
  "value": 0,
  "multiplicationFactor": 0.8,
  "additionalScore": 20
}

DELETE {{IDS.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/users/{{commonUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###
